{"text": "Then the second son went into the forest with a cake and wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also refused to share, and his axe hit his leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Simpleton said, Father, let me go and cut wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His father did not want him to go, but Simpleton begged. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His mother gave him a cake baked in ashes and some sour beer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The little gray old man asked him for food, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Let us sit down and eat together, said Simpleton kindly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly the cake was sweeter, and the beer was now good wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You have a good heart, so I will give you luck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Cut down that old tree, and look at its roots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Simpleton cut it down and found a goose with feathers of pure gold.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "e", "c", "o", "n", "d", " ", "s", "o", "n", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "c", "a", "k", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "i", "n", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "a", "l", "s", "o", " ", "r", "e", "f", "u", "s", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "h", "a", "r", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "a", "x", "e", " ", "h", "i", "t", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "l", "e", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "S", "i", "m", "p", "l", "e", "t", "o", "n", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "F", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", ",", " ", "l", "e", "t", " ", "m", "e", " ", "g", "o", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "u", "t", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i